    "text": "Ferdinand Weber | Becvar & Son Funeral Home and Cremation Care\nFerdinand Weber | Becvar & Son Funeral Home and Cremation Care\nA man known for his willingness to offer a helping hand, Weber will be remembered fondly as a loving grandfather and great-grandfather. Visitation will be held on Wednesday, July 30, 2025, at the Becvar & Son Funeral Home. Ferdinand Weber's presence will be deeply missed by his family and friends alike.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
